 <h3><u>Suno arsh walo Sehra ali ka</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Mubarak-3<br> Ali Ali<br> Marhaba-6</p> 
  <p>Madina e nabawi ko sajaya jata Hai,<br> zameen e sehra ko jannat banaya jata hai,<br> KHUDA ki sari KHUDAYI khadi hai sunne ko,<br> ABU TURAB ka sehra sunaya jata hai.<br> Mubarak-5</p> 
  <p>Mubarak mubarak tumhe ya NABI<br> ALI aur ZEHRA ki shadi hui,<br> {Suno arsh walo'n Suno farsh walo'n<br> mai sehra ALI ka sunane chala hun} -4</p> 
  <p>Jo sun kar ye sehra hai jalte hamesha-2<br> Unhe aur bhi mai sunane jalane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>1) Padhu'n tere DADA ki shadi ka manzar,<br> Ay mere IMAM E ZAMANA&nbsp; madad kar<br> Maula madad kar<br> Tasavvur me har ek momin ko-2<br> ALI ka barati banane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>2) KHUDA kehta hoga agar hota KABAH,<br> Mere Ghar se hi jati (baraat iski)-2<br> Ye mera WALI hai so iske liye mai<br> madine ko KABAH banane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>3) KHUDA k WALI ki hai shadi ka mauqa,<br> Siwaye charagho'n k kuch na jalega,<br> Kaha ye farishte ne hukm e KHUDA SE<br> mai naar e jahannum bujhane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>4) Ata karke HAIDER ko ZEHRA si zauja,<br> Pukara falak par ye (MABOOD mera)-2<br> ALI ne banayi hai qismat jahan ki<br> ALI ki mai qismat banane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>5) KHUDA keh raha tha MOHAMMED falak par,<br> Kai baar aaye the ZEHRA ki khatir,<br> So mera'j ka ab naya mai thikana<br> dar E MURTUZA ko banane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>6) Ghadi rukhsati ki Takkalum jab aayi,<br> Hijab E ILAHI se awaaz aayi-2<br> ALI meri Surat hai ZEHRA hai aayat-2<br> Mai Aayat se Surat milane chala hun.</p> 
  <p>Suno arsh walo'n Suno farsh walo'n<br> mai sehra ALI ka sunane chala hun.</p> 
